:: Poppy Christmas Afterglow
<<effects>>
<<if $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>><<ejaculation>><</if>>
<<set $christmas_poppy_flat_done to 1>>
<<if window.markPoppyInteraction>>
	<<run markPoppyInteraction()>>
<</if>>
<<npcincr Poppy love 2>><<npcincr Poppy lust -10>>
"Well, that was certainly something, wasn't it? We should do that again some time," <<he>> says as <<he>> holds you close, savouring the bliss of the moment.
<br><br>
After a little while, you get dressed, say your goodbyes, and leave.
<br><br>
<<script>>T.poppyChristmasUnlock = setup.specialClothes.filter(_clothes => _clothes.sets && _clothes.sets.includes("christmas")).map(_clothes => _clothes.name);<</script>>
<<if _poppyChristmasUnlock.length>>
<<print specialClothesUnlockText(_poppyChristmasUnlock, "christmas")>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<endcombat>><<pass 30>><<clotheson>>
<<link [[Next|Flats]]>><</link>>
